{"key": "3f685ce6aabc99a0a133e2e02b862250", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"text": "Não encontrei vendas de sexta na sua agenda dos últimos 7 dias. As vendas registradas são de 01/11 e 02/11:\n\n- **Pix** (02/11, 1 venda): R$ 64,00, pago em 02/11.\n- **Débito** (02/11, 2 vendas): R$ 200,50, pago hoje, 03/11.\n- **Crédito** (01/11, 1 venda): R$ 500,00, agendado para 01/12.\n- **Crédito** (02/11, 2 vendas): R$ 549,90, agendado para 02/12.\n\n**Antecipação:** só há valores agendados no crédito, num total de R$ 1.049,90. Posso propor a antecipação desses recebíveis. Você confirma a proposta e depois um atendente precisa aprovar, conforme [policy:capabilities]. Nada é executado antes disso.\n\nQuer que eu proponha a antecipação do crédito?", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggS3miHdpftVgdawYBkQ", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4193, "output_tokens": 464, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 147}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-hard-04#0"}
{"key": "71c8644417dc907f2b8202d1083404da", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Short answer: it looks like yes, you need an account. The sources don't say so outright.\n\n- Pix works through a checking account, a savings account or a prepaid payment account [1].\n- To sign up for Pix with Getnet, you enter the same key you registered for the bank account (\"domicílio bancário\") where you'll receive Pix payments [3].\n- Pix keys are tied to a transactional account. Individuals can have up to 5 keys per account and businesses up to 20 [2].\n- Getnet also has its own account, Get Conta, which has a Pix option [4].\n\nThe passages don't state whether a bank account is strictly required to use Getnet's Pix.\n\nMISSING: explicit statement on whether Getnet Pix requires a bank account", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggS4NGuceES1wuiM98Q9", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4037, "output_tokens": 239, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-hard-05#0"}
{"key": "7053f8182a4aef6dc5f913f7e7d53053", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Para antecipar, o que as fontes trazem é o conceito: o cliente pode receber antecipadamente os valores das vendas no crédito, à vista ou parceladas, sem esperar o prazo de compensação [1]. Sobre a Antecipação Automática, ela é condição para a isenção de quem escolhe o plano \"Receba Conforme suas Vendas\". Como envolve aprovação de crédito, a Getnet avalia cada contrato individualmente e decide se concede o produto [2].\n\nPelo assistente, posso propor a solicitação de antecipação dos recebíveis agendados. Ela exige a sua confirmação e, depois, a aprovação de um atendente antes de ser executada [policy:capabilities]. A proposta não confirmada expira em 15 minutos [policy:capabilities]. Nada foi solicitado até agora.\n\nAs fontes não trazem o passo a passo para contratar a antecipação, taxas nem prazos.\n\nMISSING: passo a passo de contratação, taxas e prazos da antecipação de recebíveis", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggS4SxSFooz1wJ7gSzmn", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4127, "output_tokens": 356, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-hard-04#0"}
{"key": "2e641b2c20654f849256e8930815a2e3", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Probably yes, but the sources don't say it outright.\n\n- Pix runs through a checking account, a savings account or a prepaid payment account [sup-duvidas-59].\n- To sign up for Pix with Getnet, you enter the same key you registered for the bank account (*domicílio bancário*) where you'll receive Pix payments [sup-duvidas-82].\n- Pix keys are tied to a transactional account [sup-duvidas-80].\n- Getnet also has its own account, Get Conta, which has a Pix option [sup-duvidas-62].\n\nThe sources don't explicitly say whether a bank account is strictly required for Getnet's Pix. I can pass this to a human agent if you want a definitive answer.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CggS4bSgF59wUxsQvbdL1", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3121, "output_tokens": 234, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-hard-05#0"}
